  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In an aerial clash with seven Tie clansmen, Fang Yuan weaves through attacks on bone wings, sometimes like a butterfly, sometimes like a goshawk, a swift, or a dragonfly. Watchers measure that control against Southern Border flying experts, including Lan Mei He.",
      "chapters": [
        361
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes Lan Mei He’s appearance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yi Huo later names famous flying Gu Masters in Southern Border: Fei You Wang, Lan Mei He, and Hong Fei Yu. He says they are feared, that battling them is extremely troublesome, and that no one wishes to make an enemy of them.",
      "chapters": [
        364
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "famous-flying-masters",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yi_huo",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_fei_you_wang",
        "char_hong_fei_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, Lan Mei He and Fei You Wang ascend the mountain and join Yi Tian Village. The pair are famous flying masters among Southern Border Gu Masters, and their arrival gives Yi Tian Village the upper hand. The righteous path invites Hong Fei Yu to resist them; alone she cannot match the two demonic path flying masters. After Hong Fei Yu is heavily injured and retreats, Wei Yang fights both Lan Mei He and Fei You Wang and stalls until more righteous reinforcements arrive, forcing the pair to retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        965
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-fighting",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "loc_yi_tian_village",
        "char_wei_yang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the righteous path’s side, Wei Yang and Hong Fei Yu later ally and gain an advantage over Lan Mei He and Fei You Wang in aerial battles.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aerial-deadlock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A later summary of the same Yi Tian Mountain fighting again places Lan Mei He and Fei You Wang ascending to join Yi Tian Village, names them famous flying masters, and retells Wei Yang stalling both until they retreat, after which Southern Border’s three famous flying masters become four with Wei Yang at the top.",
      "chapters": [
        1000
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-summary",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
